| 4a | AT THE MERGE | the lit house, before the merge (operator, 2026-11-16: //"P8 moves to before the merge."//), on the renamed house after the swap (rank 4). BUILT (2026-11-17): the steward, engineer and referee lit at the pūlama, `pulama admit` naming the set `h0`, `h1`, `h2` lent to the node, and the unlock by the pūlama gathering no route; then the first keep pushed (`par`) and `L44` the host-hook aftermath (the operator's one `lares home tend`, generation 4, seating the SessionEnd keep hook); then the burn (rank 4e), CI green at `efe961c2f`, PR #218's merge to `main` (`e844e0d8b`), and `develop` cut from it at the same commit, the integration branch every lane cuts from and merges into while `main` carries releases (#/rulings, 2026-11-07; lar:///ha.ka.ba/kahua/memory/project/develop-flow) | The merge landed on a house already worn the way it runs: lit across every rebuild, kept, its hooks seated; every act belonged to the operator's hand. |

